SUMMARY:PPSN 2026 · Conference
DESCRIPTION:International Conference on Parallel Problem Solving from Natur
 e\nStatus: confirmed\, checked 2026-10-31\nOfficial source: https://ppsn2
 026.disi.unitn.it/\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#p
 psn-2026\nNotes: 19th PPSN\, hosted by the University of Trento at Trento
  Expo\; workshops and tutorials Aug 29-30\, main program Aug 31-Sep 2. In
  person only (virtual participation not possible). Single-blind LNCS pape
 rs of up to 14 pages plus references\; all accepted papers are posters an
 d appear in Springer LNCS 16985-16989. The Mar 28 paper deadline was exte
 nded to Apr 18 and notification from May 22 to May 27\; workshop/tutorial
  proposals moved from Feb 8 to Feb 22. All cutoffs are end of day AoE. Th
 e live site hides its dates\; archived snapshots are cited. Workshop pape
 rs are not in the proceedings. Size M from 165 papers in 8 poster session
 s\; no official acceptance rate found. Size is an editorial estimate.
CATEGORIES:Evolutionary Computation & Optimization,Machine Learning
URL:https://ppsn2026.disi.unitn.it/
LOCATION:Trento\, Italy
END:VEVENT
